  {
   "id": "concept2",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Simplifying with De Morgan"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "To simplify an expression with a long bar, apply De Morgan step by step from the outermost bar inward, then use the basic laws. Simplification reduces the number of gates and inputs needed, making circuits cheaper and faster."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Work from the outermost bar inward"
    },
    {
     "en": "Then apply complement, absorption and other laws"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Take the longest bar first, break it with De Morgan, and then tidy up with the basic laws.",
    "kn": "ಮೊದಲು ಉದ್ದವಾದ ಗೆರೆಯನ್ನು ಡಿ ಮಾರ್ಗನ್‌ನಿಂದ ಮುರಿಯಿರಿ, ನಂತರ ಮೂಲ ನಿಯಮಗಳಿಂದ ಸರಳಗೊಳಿಸಿ."
   }
  },
